            "review_text": "Luong Quang N\n2 contributions\n2\nMy best experience with Hanoi’s nightlife\nMay 2023 • Friends\nFirst time visitor, my impression with Remedy was beyond any expectation. The atmosphere was easygoing and comfortable. The drink I had was the signature Serotonin, light and aromatic. The bartender was charming and charismatic with lovely sense of humor. The interior was decorated with dark academia theme with wooden furniture. My experience was delightful and remedy will definitely on my go-to list, everytime I visit Vietnam\nRead more\nWritten May 17, 2023",
